                                  ],
                                  "additionalProperties": false,
                                  "description": "A point uses effective_from and effective_to null. An interval uses inclusive effective_from and exclusive effective_to; projection intervals must be bounded. Unknown source time uses kind unknown with both bounds null. Granularity describes the UTC carrier: day requires midnight UTC boundaries; year also requires January 1. Use second when converted boundaries are not UTC day/year aligned; this carrier encoding does not justify claiming finer evidence precision. Preserve the full supplied period, never replace it with an arbitrary instant."
                                }
